From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash-Awasthi <yashawasthi12032006@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:57:51 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] target/riscv: add the Xattn extension

The attn helper runs attn_core.h over guest memory with precise faults; -cpu ...,xattn=on enables it and the disassembler decodes it.
